### Auto
path: "crossbeam_spawn.at"
```auto
dep crossbeam
use.rs crossbeam

fn main() {
    crossbeam.scope(s => {
        s.spawn(_ => {
            print("Hello from scoped thread 1")
        })
        s.spawn(_ => {
            print("Hello from scoped thread 2")
        })
    }).unwrap()
    assert(true)
}
```

